Task: Implement POST /inventory/reserve http4s route (Phase 3, walking-skeleton track)

Summary: Added inventoryservice.InventoryRoutes.routes[F: Concurrent], an HttpRoutes[F] wiring POST /inventory/reserve to InventoryStore.reserve, returning 201 Created with the Reservation as JSON. Added ReserveRequest case class + circe Codec (request body), and a Codec[Reservation] on InventoryStore.scala's companion (response body) — both via semiauto derivation. Route bound on Concurrent[F] (not Sync, not Async) — the minimal capability http4s-circe's EntityDecoder/EntityEncoder actually require. Followed Red-Green TDD.

